Entries of a dependencies keyword must be arrays of strings or schemas.

-- schema.json --
{
    "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
    "dependencies": {
        "a": 1234
    }
}
-- out/decode/extract --
ERROR:
value of "a" in "dependencies" must be an array of strings, an object, or a boolean, found int:
    schema.json:4:10
